Objectives: Movie Watchlist Manager Using Singly Linked List (SLL)

1. To develop a Movie Watchlist Manager using C++ and a Singly Linked List.
2. To add new movies to the watchlist dynamically.
3. To remove a movie from the watchlist by its name.
4. To display all movies stored in the watchlist.
5. To understand node creation, pointers, and dynamic memory allocation.
6. To implement insertion, deletion, and traversal operations in a Singly Linked List.
7. To manage the watchlist efficiently using linked-list concepts.
